<title>JAPAN: Japan Apr-June output seen down 0.3% qtr/qtr--MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Apr-June output seen down 0.3% qtr/qtr--MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Friday that Japan's industrial output in the April-June quarter was expected to fall 0.3 percent from the previous quarter.</p>
<p>But on a year-on-year basis, MITI said it expected output in the April-June period to rise 6.5 percent.</p>
</text>
